# Backstop only. package.json's "files" field is the real allowlist, and npm
# does NOT let an ignore file exclude anything inside a directory listed there:
# with `template/` whitelisted, a stale template/.skrapa or template/dist is
# packed regardless of the rules below (verified with `npm pack --dry-run`).
# The `prepack` script is what actually keeps build artifacts out of the
# tarball, and so out of every project `skrapa init` scaffolds from it.
#
# These rules still matter if "files" is ever narrowed or dropped.
.skrapa
.tmp
dist
*.tsbuildinfo
